      "text": "Nine people are killed and eight others injured after a minibus collides with a truck between Krasne, Mykolaiv Raion, Mykolaiv Oblast and Nechayane, Mykolaiv Oblast, Ukraine. ((Xinhua))"
    },
    {
      "category": "International relations",
      "text": "A Russian cultural center in Chișinău, Moldova, closes after the government orders its shutdown, citing security concerns linked to Russian influence and drone incidents amid strained bilateral relations. ((Reuters))"
    },
